  "biography": {
    "plain_text": "Karl Heckl was a Munich construction entrepreneur and civil engineer who served as president of TSV 1860 Munich from 1984 to 1988. He entered football administration as a millionaire from the building industry. Club delegates elected him president after he had initially said he would not stand for the presidency.",
    "confidence": {
